{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_026yur0233_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_026yur0233_1000_p", "source_sha256": "67ee6307863fc960849045e06b1411a7c43816ad0ed7152e3f36fad0b88ed5e4", "ja": "（今日は大運動会イベントに向けての打ち合わせ。\n同席した百合子は、真剣に話を聞いていた……）", "zh": "（今天要为大型运动会活动开会商议。同席的百合子一直认真地听着……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_026yur0233_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_026yur0233_1001_p", "source_sha256": "489dfcf5237416d3d388d0e4f3aa8b952d826661c79b534a483977085384faf2", "ja": "百合子、お疲れさま。\n打ち合わせ、ずいぶん集中していたな。", "zh": "百合子，辛苦了。\n刚才开会时，你真是十分专注啊。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_026yur0233_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_026yur0233_1002_026yur", "source_sha256": "55f19c1811947dfccc8e6db5d09613efae40c5900ffc11a1dea0cc11de569e6c", "ja": "はい！　運動はあまり得意じゃないので……。\nその分、みんなよりしっかり準備したいと思って。", "zh": "是的！我不太擅长运动……所以想在准备上比大家更加充分。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_026yur0233_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_026yur0233_1003_026yur", "source_sha256": "192842dd9c80cdebbf1850fe32b68112ff79529a16eb48c1a9b5a10eb1592f6e", "ja": "あっ、そういえば、見ましたか！？\nあの見本刷り、とっても素敵でしたよね。", "zh": "啊，对了，你看到了吗！？\n那份样刊，真的特别棒呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_026yur0233_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_026yur0233_1004_p", "source_sha256": "eef6e3f92868881a3ac3c4d4b16127039c9b391d563c8ef962ca029df95206ac", "ja": "見本刷り？　ああ、イベントパンフレットの事か。\n確かに、凝ったつくりだったな。", "zh": "样张？哦，是说活动宣传册啊。\n确实，做得挺精致的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_026yur0233_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_026yur0233_1005_026yur", "source_sha256": "45393e9d6383cab07e3599e79a0c613a09deaf7973e4f5c7434583b59bcb009f", "ja": "はい！　装丁もしっかりしてましたし……。\nそれに、煽り文句のセンスが素晴らしくて！", "zh": "是的！装帧也很精致……而且，宣传文案的风格实在太棒了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_026yur0233_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_026yur0233_1006_026yur", "source_sha256": "036233fa42796d0a7a496ebf7178e4eb9a925d911fd16c38abf6a4de01197c2e", "ja": "駆け抜けろ、風のように！　とか、\nいざゆかん、戦士たちよ！　とか……。", "zh": "“像风一样奔驰吧！”之类的，\n还有“战士们啊，现在出发吧！”之类的……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_026yur0233_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_026yur0233_1007_026yur", "source_sha256": "35c90fdb341d7c7cba93c32e51bcb8558e5328e2deb275d66f873096ae0e6836", "ja": "読んでいるだけで、私もそんな気になっちゃって。\n活躍できるかも！　なんて……えへへ。", "zh": "光是读着这些，我也不由得产生了那样的感觉。说不定我也能大显身手！什么的……嘿嘿。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_026yur0233_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_026yur0233_1008_p", "source_sha256": "a665f0149c81486be04ed7c693e01b8e024b13b51355848e7667a1f570a545ac", "ja": "そうか、モチベーションが高いのはありがたいよ。\n実は少しだけ、心配してたから。", "zh": "这样啊，你干劲十足真是太好了。其实我之前还有点担心呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_026yur0233_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_026yur0233_1009_026yur", "source_sha256": "70bac5e6f8203c4eb530b195aed2494f52230710813a2556712140588b4ebf92", "ja": "えっ、心配って……{$P$}さん、\n心配してくれてたんですか？", "zh": "诶，担心……{$P$}先生，您一直在担心我吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_026yur0233_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_026yur0233_1010_p", "source_sha256": "aa7e1621c053158b63e1207b901d22ebeebcdd9d1e2eb9e7cd0f4e30d81f0fd8", "ja": "まあ、百合子が運動に苦手意識があるのは、\n知ってるし……でも、その様子ならいけそうだな！", "zh": "毕竟我知道百合子对运动有抵触情绪……\n不过，看你现在的样子应该没问题吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_026yur0233_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_026yur0233_1011_026yur", "source_sha256": "88e29c2c686a8d7336725806176a49fbb7b5b8601b7f62c61649ee2add0cd16e", "ja": "あ！　いえ、それなら……やっぱり少し不安です！\nあの、実は私、運動がすっごく苦手で！", "zh": "啊！不，如果是那样的话……果然还是有点不安！\n那个，其实我非常不擅长运动！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_026yur0233_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_026yur0233_1012_p", "source_sha256": "9aa7332206af967d787c846095eef6fecddb45ed288ff6ded2fd64477028f19c", "ja": "えっ、急に……。まあ、知ってるけど。", "zh": "诶，怎么突然……不过，我知道就是了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_026yur0233_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_026yur0233_1013_026yur", "source_sha256": "0d74c89211c83b2322ff117652265035b02bde89a763da58deaa8b9d8382365a", "ja": "その、なので、{$P$}さんの\n手厚いサポートは必要かなって思ったり……。", "zh": "那个，所以，我想还是需要{$P$}先生的悉心支持……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_026yur0233_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_026yur0233_1014_p", "source_sha256": "281401a907550a5835bc834c3dfb9e0503b183228221eb4b08c85ad38cd28bee", "ja": "そうか、だったら……基礎体力作りのために、\n走り込みをしよう。付き合うよ！", "zh": "这样啊，那就……为了锻炼基础体能，去跑步吧。我陪你一起！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_026yur0233_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_026yur0233_1015_026yur", "source_sha256": "81cbe6114d740af142bacd47fc520b74bc0d1fda9f7bf73bb2388a46f5ec7f19", "ja": "は、走り込み……うぅ、聞いただけで息切れが……。\nでも、{$P$}さんと一緒……！", "zh": "跑、跑步训练……呜，只是听听就已经喘不过气了……  \n不过，和{$P$}先生一起……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_026yur0233_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_026yur0233_1016_026yur", "source_sha256": "37b4e7a2f645438426664c4e4ea4ddd602052d7e4654e4c1c0bf715eee2664a9", "ja": "わかりました！　苦手を克服するためにも……、\nよろしくお願いします、コーチ！", "zh": "我明白了！为了克服自己的弱项……  \n请多多指教，教练！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_026yur0233_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_026yur0233_1017_p", "source_sha256": "9c037cac09bb0ca2dca2370820fc31d0bd72688326f3b94dd03db7880e7aa148", "ja": "（おお、百合子が燃えている……よし、鉄は熱いうちに\n打てだ！　今日はレッスンのフルコースだな！）", "zh": "（哦，百合子干劲十足啊……好，正所谓要趁热打铁！今天就来一套完整的课程吧！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
